    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i get the vibration part but it's hard to actually feel it when i'm speaking. if i want to test it on myself, like how do i know for sure if i am actually voicing the /z/ or if it's just a loud /s/? is there a specific way to check the physical sensation in my throat?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
